---
---

<section class="section-features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="wood-badge">✨ Authentic Zen Experience</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Why Players Love Woody Sort Game</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Designed from the ground up for smooth tactile satisfaction, organic wooden aesthetics, and brain-stimulating fun.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">🪵</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">Rustic Woodcraft Aesthetics</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Warm natural oak, walnut, and bamboo textures paired with soothing synthesized acoustic wooden clacks and forest breeze sounds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">💡</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">Smart AI Solver & Hints</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Stuck on a tricky configuration? Our built-in BFS puzzle solver calculates the exact optimal next move without spoiling the entire puzzle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">🗝️</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">Secret Hidden Chambers</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Earn 3-star ratings across campaign levels to unlock mystery hidden levels with intricate trap stacks and bonus coin payouts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">Infinite Solvable Levels</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Enjoy 50+ curated campaign stages followed by an infinite procedural solvable level generator that ensures non-stop replayability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">📱</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">Instant Play on Any Device</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Zero downloads, zero loading screens, zero storage bloat. Play seamlessly on mobile phones, tablets, and desktop browsers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6 -->
      <div class="woody-card feature-card">
        <div class="feat-icon-box">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">100% Free & Family Friendly</h3>
        <p class="feat-desc">
          Pure casual puzzle entertainment. No real money gambling or paywalls. Perfect for kids, adults, and seniors alike.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-features {
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--wood-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
  }

  .feat-icon-box {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .feat-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--wood-gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .feat-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
